#: scenario8:scenario8_30A39052_C8A3_4A9B_8C97_41A807382651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5b91d7262ae8628bcdcbf859e96994aafdd3466721e611ef16941da33b258f0
