msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was with her, I was in the role of her lover.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She never questioned my love "
"for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Находясь с ней, я играл роль ее возлюбленного.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Она никогда не сомневалась в моей "
"любви,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E14A007_20AC_4A61_97F4_1B3027DA0750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72a7453713e35f99aea610878edc629437f61da7486a18230f414e13e1c8d5ff
